"updated": 1786600000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "fan-out math\n60 segments x 5 renditions\n= ~300 idempotent tasks\nspot instances, retry cost = 3 s", "originalText": "fan-out math\n60 segments x 5 renditions\n= ~300 idempotent tasks\nspot instances, retry cost = 3 s", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "roundness": null}, {"id": "y66", "type": "rectangle", "x": 9230, "y": 4500, "width": 330, "height": 180, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 1338085497, "version": 100, "versionNonce": 640192360, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786600000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "y67", "type": "text", "x": 9248, "y": 4512, "width": 183.04000000000002, "height": 96.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 1572928729, "version": 100, "versionNonce": 172610048, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786600000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "S3 PROCESSED layout\nvid_9f2a/master.m3u8\nvid_9f2a/720p/index.m3u8\nvid_9f2a/720p/seg_0001.ts\n\nread time URL =\nCDN_DOMAIN + \"/\" + manifest_path", "originalText": "S3 PROCESSED layout\nvid_9f2a/master.m3u8\nvid_9f2a/720p/index.m3u8\nvid_9f2a/720p/seg_0001.ts\n\nread time URL =\nCDN_DOMAIN + \"/\" + manifest_path", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "roundness": null}, {"id": "y68", "type": "text", "x": 9620, "y": 3285, "width": 424.32, "height": 435.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 2128967091, "version": 100, "versionNonce": 2138245141, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786600000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "RULES THAT MAKE THIS CORRECT\n\n1  Bucket state is the source of truth, not the DB row.\n    object-created fires -> the DB row follows.\n2  The server never touches video bytes. The client\n    PUTs parts straight to S3 with pre-signed URLs.\n3  upload_job DB is the only CP store. Every other\n    store on this canvas is AP.\n4  Never dual-write DB + Elasticsearch. ES is fed\n    from video.ready, after the row already says READY.\n5  Transcode is async. A dead worker only grows the\n    Kafka backlog, it never fails an upload.\n6  Every transcode task is idempotent, keyed by\n    (videoId, segment, rendition). Retry is free.\n7  Read path is Redis 60 s + read replica. Never primary.\n8  manifest_path is stored RELATIVE. The CDN domain is\n    added at read time -> swapping CDN = 1 env var.\n9  Adaptive bitrate is client-driven. Same segment\n    number, different rendition folder.\n10 View count is fire and forget, eventually consistent.\n\nWHAT THE OLD DIAGRAM GOT WRONG   (shape, not facts)\n\nx  10 disconnected strips     ->  one system, one canvas\nx  Kafka drawn three times    ->  one broker, three topics\nx  no store column                ->  every service lands on\n                                                its own row\nx  schema floating far off      ->  schema sits on the row\n                                                of its owner service", "originalText": "RULES THAT MAKE THIS CORRECT\n\n1  Bucket state is the source of truth, not the DB row.\n    object-created fires -> the DB row follows.\n2  The server never touches video bytes. The client\n    PUTs parts straight to S3 with pre-signed URLs.\n3  upload_job DB is the only CP store. Every other\n    store on this canvas is AP.\n4  Never dual-write DB + Elasticsearch. ES is fed\n    from video.ready, after the row already says READY.\n5  Transcode is async. A dead worker only grows the\n    Kafka backlog, it never fails an upload.\n6  Every transcode task is idempotent, keyed by\n    (videoId, segment, rendition). Retry is free.\n7  Read path is Redis 60 s + read replica. Never primary.\n8  manifest_path is stored RELATIVE. The CDN domain is\n    added at read time -> swapping CDN = 1 env var.\n9  Adaptive bitrate is client-driven. Same segment\n    number, different rendition folder.\n10 View count is fire and forget, eventually consistent.\n\nWHAT THE OLD DIAGRAM GOT WRONG   (shape, not facts)\n\nx  10 disconnected strips     ->  one system, one canvas\nx  Kafka drawn three times    ->  one broker, three topics\nx  no store column                ->  every service lands on\n                                                its own row\nx  schema floating far off      ->  schema sits on the row\n                                                of its owner service", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "roundness": null}, {"id": "y69", "type": "arrow", "x": 7670, "y": 3620, "width": 70, "height": 0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 870742413, "version": 100, "versionNonce": 1772196923, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786600000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [70, 0]], "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "elbowed": false, "roundness": null}, {"id": "y70", "type": "text", "x": 7672, "y": 3582, "width": 32.76, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgr